@startuml workflow-targets
skinparam backgroundColor #F8FAFC
skinparam defaultFontName Helvetica
skinparam defaultFontSize 17
skinparam shadowing false
hide footbox
title Independent target capture — input or menus, without desktop control
actor User
participant Client
participant "Koine\nGraphQL + grants" as Host
participant "Input OR menus\nprovider" as Provider
Client -> Client: capture process PID + kernel start instant
Client -> Host: query own-provider target/state
Host -> Host: check own-provider read
Host -> Provider: resolve captured incarnation
Provider --> Host: own opaque references + state / explicit failure
Host --> Client: publish after live read check
Client -> Client: derive choices from returned state
Client --> User: present choices
User -> Client: choose
Client -> Host: mutation with unchanged own-provider reference
Host -> Host: preflight all selected actions\nthen live dispatch admission
Host -> Provider: admitted own-provider control operation
alt known stale target or lost consent
Provider --> Host: unavailable / permission
else valid under accepted native limits
Provider -> Provider: act without reclaiming desktop focus
Provider --> Host: control-authorized receipt / failed
end
Host --> Client: receipt or classified error
note over Client,Provider
Designed, not yet served. Read and control are independent.
No desktop reference is decoded or converted.
No automatic retry; native race limits still apply.
Menu items remain bound to their validated context target.
end note
@enduml
